{"product":{"id":36132651027,"title":"Roaster's Choice Subscription","body_html":"\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e⭐ Roaster's Choice subscriptions ship free!\u003cbr\u003e⭐ Fixed pricing on each subscription option.\u003cbr\u003e⭐ Bag slot 1 (one bag subs) - light\/ultralight, easy to brew, accessible and sessionable coffees.\u003cbr\u003e⭐ Bag slot 2 (two bag subs) - ultralight\/hyperlight, rare and exotic varieties, exceptional processes, auction-lot winners, elevated offerings.\u003cbr\u003e⭐ Add-on extra bags and products and bundle with your subscription to receive free shipping with code ADDON at checkout! (must have active subscription)\u003cbr\u003e⭐ Active subscribers receive 10% off automatically on regular orders in our store (Current Offerings collection, coffee only)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNew Roaster's Choice subscriptions are currently paused.\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eJuly Roaster's Choice coffees are:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBag slot #1 (1 bag subscriptions)  \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLa Fortuna Pink Bourbon\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan\u003eHuila, Colombia\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWashed Pink Bourbon\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWhite peach, starfruit, orange blossom\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan\u003eUltralight roast\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBag slot #2 (2 bag subscriptions)  \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLa Fortuna Bourbon Aji\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan\u003eHuila, Colombia\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWashed Bourbon Aji\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePink Lemonade, pomegranate, pineapple\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan\u003eUltralight roast\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\"\u003eOur favorite coffees delivered to your door on a monthly schedule. Our Roaster's Choice subscriptions offer up to two unique bags each month. In addition, rarely, some coffees will be subscriber-only. Finally, rarely, something extra special will be included in each subscription.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eSubscriptions renew on the 10th of each month-- if you signup for a new subscription between the 1st and the 9th, your order will process on the 10th. If you signup for a new subscription after that, your first order will process on the regular weekly schedule, and your renewal will be set for the 10th of the next month.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eManage your subscription anytime with an account. It's easy and secure. Cancel anytime.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eLocal delivery:\u003cbr\u003eIf your address is within 10 miles of the H\u0026amp;S Roastery, we can offer local delivery-- just pick the option during checkout! (If you don't see the option, you are not within the delivery area-- please get in touch to arrange a local pickup option).\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eLocal pickup:\u003cbr\u003ePlease contact us to arrange local pickups.\u003c\/p\u003e","vendor":"H+S Coffee Roasters","product_type":"Coffee Subscription","created_at":"2017-11-09T18:37:47-07:00","handle":"roasters-choice-subscription","updated_at":"2026-10-08T16:23:56-06:00","published_at":"2025-09-02T08:59:53-06:00","template_suffix":"","published_scope":"web","tags":"","variants":[{"id":40771172925498,"product_id":36132651027,"title":"1 bag, 125g (4.4oz)","price":"16.00","sku":"RCS1251_1bag-125g","position":1,"inventory_policy":"deny","compare_at_price":"","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_manag